  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-26T12:09:17.118Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With 100+ people on a freinds list, whilst sleeping in VR it would be nice to have a white-listed few that are allowed to join.\n\nSay you know someone who doesn't know that you are sleeping (and hasn't read your status) even though you are laying down and snoring, you don't want them to join.\n\nI don't want to tell them \"please don't join\" I just want them to see me as 'do not disturb' (red) and be unable to join.",
